---
title: "Sale Lifecycle State Machine (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_initialized: initialize()
    q_initialized --> q_open_application: startTime reached
    q_open_application --> q_open_application: invest() - investors deposit capital
    q_open_application --> q_ended: end() called by Legion or projectAdmin
    q_ended --> q_refund_period: hasEnded = true, refund period starts
    q_refund_period --> q_refund_period: investors may request refunds
    q_refund_period --> q_post_refund: block.timestamp >= refundEndTime
    q_post_refund --> q_capital_published: publishRaisedCapital(amount)
    q_capital_published --> q_capital_withdrawn: withdrawRaisedCapital() by projectAdmin
    q_capital_published --> q_results_published: publishSaleResults(root, tokens, askToken)
    q_capital_withdrawn --> q_results_published: publishSaleResults(root, tokens, askToken)
    q_results_published --> q_tokens_supplied: supplyTokens() by projectAdmin
    q_tokens_supplied --> q_distribution: claimTokenAllocation() by investors
    q_distribution --> q_distribution: releaseVestedTokens() over time
    q_distribution --> [*]: all tokens claimed and vested

    q_open_application --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_ended --> q_cancelled: cancel() by projectAdmin
    q_capital_published --> q_cancelled: cancel() (must return capital + fees)
    q_capital_withdrawn --> q_cancelled: cancel() (must return capital + fees)
    q_cancelled --> [*]: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled() by investors

    note right of q_open_application
        INV-001: No predetermined end time - manual conclusion only
        INV-002: invest() blocked after hasEnded = true
    end note

    note right of q_capital_published
        INV-003: Capital publication requires refund period to have expired
        INV-004: Raised capital withdrawal enables early fund access before TGE
    end note

    note right of q_cancelled
        INV-005: Cancellation only before token supply
        INV-006: Post-withdrawal cancellation requires full capital + fee return
        INV-007: Cancelled sale allows full investor refunds
    end note
